            <ul class="list-unstyled small">
                <li><i class="bi bi-phone"></i> Tél: 06.42.02.56.29</li>
                <li><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i> Email: wetta.rene@gmail.com</li>
                <li><i class="bi bi-geo-alt"></i> Adresse: 14540 Bourguébus</li>
                <li><i class="bi bi-globe"></i> Web: <a href="http://je-developpe.fr" target="_blank" class="text-white text-decoration-none fw-bold">je-developpe.fr</a></li>
